<section class="faq" data-section="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal center" style="display:block;text-align:center;">FAQ</div>
    <h2 class="section-h reveal center">Zero-surprise answers.</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item reveal" data-question="shipping-time">
        <summary>How long does shipping take?</summary>
        <p>Most orders ship in 3&ndash;7 days from our shop in Woods Cross, Utah. Current ship window is shown at checkout, and you&rsquo;ll get tracking by email the moment it leaves the warehouse.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item reveal" data-question="existing-post">
        <summary>I already have a post &mdash; do I need the bundle?</summary>
        <p>Our post slides over a wooden 4x4 or bolts to concrete, so most people install it fresh. If you want to keep a mailbox post from another brand, the $40 mailbox bracket adapter lets <em>The Malone</em> mount to it. A wall-mounted version is also available if you&rsquo;d rather skip the post entirely.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item reveal" data-question="numbers-included">
        <summary>Are the house numbers included?</summary>
        <p>Not in the base mailbox price. The 4-inch address numbers are magnetic, anodized aluminum, and $13 per number &mdash; snap them on, no tools needed.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item reveal" data-question="lock">
        <summary>Can I lock it?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Add the locking mechanism for $30 at checkout for extra peace of mind on mail and small packages.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item reveal" data-question="exchanges">
        <summary>What if I don&rsquo;t love it?</summary>
        <p>Free 30-day exchanges. If the color or size isn&rsquo;t right, we&rsquo;ll make it right.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item reveal" data-question="who-makes-it">
        <summary>Who actually makes this?</summary>
        <p>A small team in Woods Cross, Utah, founded by Danny &amp; Veronica. Every Malone is hand-finished in our own warehouse &mdash; not drop-shipped from a catalog.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
